  "uprn": "100021514171",
  "decision_date": "20/05/2005",
  "description": "Change of use from car parking facility /wardens base stores to neighbourhood housing facility including single storey front extension to existing building.",
  "site_name": "Boulton House",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "23/05/2005",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "TW8 0DA",
  "street_name": "Green Dragon Lane",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major all other major developments",
  "lapsed_date": "19/05/2010",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - It is considered that this application for the change of use at Boulton House to provide a neighbourhood housing facility and wardens base will not have an adverse affect upon the appearance of the building or upon adjoining residential occupiers, in terms of noise and disturbance.  On balance, the development is in accordance with Policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development) and C.1.4 (New social and Community Facilities) of the London Borough of Hounslow UDP, Adopted December 2003; It is considered that where the development is not compliant there are no undue adverse effects resulting from this.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority (before the building(s) is/are occupied/used).",
    "Condition : 4 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 5 - Prior to the commencement of development a drawing shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority, showing the provision of cycle racks. Prior to the occupation of the premises, the racks shall be installed and thereafter be permanently retained  \r\n\r\nReason: To encourage means of transport other than the private car.\r\n",
    "Condition : 7 - A drawing showing the proposed eastern elevation of the underground car park shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority prior to the commencement of development.\r\n\r\nReason: In order for the Local Planning Authority to assess the external appearance of the proposal \r\n",
    "Condition : 8 - Before the development hereby permitted is commenced a scheme indicating the provision to be made for disabled people to gain access to the neighbourhood housing facility shall have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The agreed scheme shall be implemented before the development hereby permitted is brought into use."
  ],
